<body lang=3D"EN-IN" link=3D"#0563C1" vlink=3D"#954F72">
<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Dear Students,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Please note the following important ins=
tructions regarding the Final CP/MP Viva:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3"=
><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt"><span style=3D"mso-l=
ist:Ignore">1.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">All student=
s must prepare the final project report and other required documents as per=
 the given checklist and submit them to their respective supervisors for ve=
rification by 14th May 2026.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3"=
><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt"><span style=3D"mso-l=
ist:Ignore">2.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Once verifi=
ed, each student must take printouts of two hard-bound copies of the final =
project report &#8212; one for personal record and one for the supervisor. =
The hard-bound report cover page must be
 in Blue colour with Golden embossing.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3"=
><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt"><span style=3D"mso-l=
ist:Ignore">3.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">For MP stud=
ents, only one hard-bound copy for the supervisor needs to be submitted for=
 the entire group, while each student must maintain one personal hard-bound=
 copy. In the personal copy, the respective
 student&#8217;s name should appear in the first position, and the names of=
 the other group members should follow.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3"=
><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt"><span style=3D"mso-l=
ist:Ignore">4.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">All student=
s must obtain the signature of the supervisor on all hard copies of the doc=
uments and the checklist before the Final Viva.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3"=
><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt"><span style=3D"mso-l=
ist:Ignore">5.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Students mu=
st upload the soft copies of the verified documents as per the checklist by=
 18th May 2026. (The upload link will be shared shortly.)<o:p></o:p></span>=
</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3"=
><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt"><span style=3D"mso-l=
ist:Ignore">6.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">The Similar=
ity Index (Plagiarism Report) and AI Plagiarism Report of the project repor=
t must be below 10%. The summary pages of both reports must be attached at =
the end of the final project report.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3"=
><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt"><span style=3D"mso-l=
ist:Ignore">7.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Students wh=
o have not completed their internship by 19th May 2026 must submit either: =
a certificate of progress, or an email confirmation from the industry super=
visor clearly mentioning the expected
 date of completion.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3"=
><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt"><span style=3D"mso-l=
ist:Ignore">8.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">The viva wi=
ll begin at 9:00 AM sharp. All students must be present at the venue well i=
n advance. The detailed schedule and venue will be shared shortly.<o:p></o:=
p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3"=
><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt"><span style=3D"mso-l=
ist:Ignore">9.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Each studen=
t must prepare a PowerPoint presentation covering the following:<o:p></o:p>=
</span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:6.55pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo5">=
<![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol"><s=
pan style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times=
 New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb=
sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Problem Sta=
tement<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:6.55pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo5">=
<![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol"><s=
pan style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times=
 New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb=
sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Objectives<=
o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:6.55pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo5">=
<![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol"><s=
pan style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times=
 New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb=
sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Methodology=
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:6.55pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo5">=
<![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol"><s=
pan style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times=
