sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Results<o:p=
></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:6.55pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo5">=
<![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol"><s=
pan style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times=
 New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb=
sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Conclusions=
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:6.55pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo5">=
<![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol"><s=
pan style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times=
 New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb=
sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Research Ou=
tcomes (Publications/Patents, if any)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:6.55pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo5">=
<![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol"><s=
pan style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times=
 New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb=
sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">References<=
o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3"=
><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt"><span style=3D"mso-l=
ist:Ignore">10.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Please note=
 the following details while preparing the final report: The degree name sh=
ould be written as: BACHELOR OF TECHNOLOGY IN COMPUTER ENGINEERING. The dep=
artment name should be written as:
 COMPUTER SCIENCE &amp; ENGINEERING<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Please adhere to all the above guidelin=
es carefully to ensure a smooth and successful viva process.<o:p></o:p></sp=
an></p>
<p><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">For any queries, kindly contact your re=
spective supervisor.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
